        <h2 class="subtitle" data-en="Deepfakes Exposed" data-es="Deepfakes al Descubierto">Deepfakes Exposed</h2>
        <p class="info" data-en="The term 'Deepfake' is a combination of the words Deep Learning (a branch of Artificial Intelligence) and Fake. It refers to any synthetic multimedia content (videos, audio, or images) that has been modified or generated with such a level of realism that it is extremely difficult to distinguish from the original." data-es="El término 'Deepfake' es la fusión de las palabras Deep Learning (Aprendizaje Profundo, una rama de la Inteligencia Artificial) y Fake (falso). Se refiere a cualquier contenido multimedia sintético (videos, audios o imágenes) que haya sido modificado o generado con tal nivel de realismo que es extremadamente difícil de distinguir del original."><span style="padding-left: 30px;"></span>The term "Deepfake" is a combination of the words Deep Learning (a branch of Artificial Intelligence) and Fake. It refers to any synthetic multimedia content (videos, audio, or images) that has been modified or generated with such a level of realism that it is extremely difficult to distinguish from the original.</p>
