      <div class="five"><h2 class="subtitle" data-en="¿What is Deep Learning?" data-es="¿Qué es el Deep Learning?">¿What is Deep Learning?</h2>
        <p class="info" data-es="El Deep Learning es la tecnología clave de la IA que da vida a los Deepfakes. Se basa en Redes Neuronales Multi-Capa que procesan datos masivos para aprender con precisión los patrones más sutiles de la apariencia y voz de una persona. Este aprendizaje exhaustivo es lo que permite la reconstrucción de identidad hiperrealista en los videos y audios falsos." data-en="Deep learning is the key AI technology behind deepfakes. It relies on multi-layered neural networks that process massive amounts of data to accurately learn the subtlest patterns in a person's appearance and voice. This comprehensive learning is what enables the hyper-realistic reconstruction of identity in fake videos and audio recordings."><span style="padding-left: 30px;"></span>Deep learning is the key AI technology behind deepfakes. It relies on multi-layered neural networks that process massive amounts of data to accurately learn the subtlest patterns in a person's appearance and voice. This comprehensive learning is what enables the hyper-realistic reconstruction of identity in fake videos and audio recordings.</p></div>


