        <h2 class="subtitle" data-es="¿Por qué los Deepfakes son una Amenaza Masiva?" data-en="Why are Deepfakes a Massive Threat?">Why are Deepfakes a Massive Threat?</h2>
        <p class="info" data-es="Los deepfakes representan una amenaza significativa debido a su capacidad para difundir desinformación, manipular opiniones públicas y cometer fraudes. Pueden ser utilizados para crear noticias falsas, suplantar identidades y realizar ataques de ingeniería social, lo que pone en riesgo la privacidad, la seguridad y la confianza en los medios digitales." data-en="Deepfakes pose a significant threat due to their ability to spread misinformation, manipulate public opinion, and commit fraud. They can be used to create fake news, impersonate identities, and conduct social engineering attacks, putting privacy, security, and trust in digital media at risk."><span style="padding-left: 30px;"></span>Deepfakes pose a significant threat due to their ability to spread misinformation, manipulate public opinion, and commit fraud. They can be used to create fake news, impersonate identities, and conduct social engineering attacks, putting privacy, security, and trust in digital media at risk.</p>
      </div>

